1
00:00:46,212 --> 00:00:50,050
一！二！三！
One! Two! Three!

2
00:00:51,926 --> 00:00:53,470
耶！
Yeah!

3
00:00:59,476 --> 00:01:01,061
加油！耶！
Come on! Yeah!

4
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:04,481
加油！
Come on!

5
00:01:13,406 --> 00:01:14,908
开始吧！加油！
Let's do this! Come on!

6
00:01:15,116 --> 00:01:16,618
加油！
Come on!

7
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,624
加油！加油！
Come on! Come on!

8
00:01:24,334 --> 00:01:26,002
来吧
Come on.

9
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:27,462
开始吧 加油
Let's do this. Come on.

10
00:01:36,179 --> 00:01:39,432
下次大家站起来的时候 让背包滑下来
Let the backpack slip off next time everyone stands.

11
00:01:53,738 --> 00:01:54,823
简在哪里？
Where's Jane?

12
00:01:54,948 --> 00:01:56,616
丹尼尔·凯尔纳
Daniel Kellner.

13
00:01:56,783 --> 00:01:59,077
你还想再见到她吗？
Do you want to see her again or not?

14
00:02:10,004 --> 00:02:11,464
放松
Relax.

15
00:02:11,548 --> 00:02:12,924
尽情享受比赛吧
Enjoy the match.

16
00:02:13,007 --> 00:02:15,176
只需确认所有东西都在那里
Just got to make sure it's all there.

17
00:02:19,556 --> 00:02:23,351
7.23.48.83
7.23.48.83

18
00:02:23,393 --> 00:02:28,022
至 3.14.84A
through 3.14.84A.

19
00:02:28,148 --> 00:02:29,691
11.17.55...
11.17.55...

20
00:02:29,816 --> 00:02:34,237
我总共制作了 107 个 IronClad 硬盘 每个 128 GB
I make a total of 107 IronClad drives, 128 gig each.

21
00:02:34,362 --> 00:02:37,407
-你想让我重新计票吗？ -嗯 等我们做完之后 是的
-You want me to do a recount? -Uh, when we finish, yes.

22
00:02:37,532 --> 00:02:39,909
打印文件约200页
Printed documents approximately 200 pages.

23
00:02:40,034 --> 00:02:41,452
日期范围是什么？
What's the date range?

24
00:02:41,536 --> 00:02:43,496
嗯 我们回去后可以把它编入目录
Uh, we can catalog that when we get back.

25
00:02:43,621 --> 00:02:46,166
但我看到的最早可以追溯到 1947 年
But I'm seeing as far back as 1947

26
00:02:46,249 --> 00:02:48,459
最近的可以追溯到去年
and as recent as last year.

27
00:03:28,416 --> 00:03:30,627
唉 这一切都太令人失望了
Well, this is all rather disappointing.

28
00:03:33,254 --> 00:03:34,714
简在哪里？
Where's Jane?

29
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:47,143
-你还好吗？ -是的
-Are you okay? -Yeah.

30
00:03:48,561 --> 00:03:50,897
小心
Careful.

31
00:03:52,982 --> 00:03:54,901
嘿
Hey.

32
00:04:01,741 --> 00:04:03,451
是谁出卖了你？
Who turned you?

33
00:04:03,534 --> 00:04:07,705
把所有人的名字都告诉我 你们俩可以叫辆出租车
Give me the names, all of them, and you two can call a cab.

34
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:09,749
它来了
It's here.

35
00:04:32,855 --> 00:04:34,274
它在哪里？
Where is it?

36
00:04:39,404 --> 00:04:40,863
把你的武器放在地上！
Put your weapon on the ground!

37
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:44,284
不要开火！不要开火
Do not fire! Do not fire.

38
00:04:44,492 --> 00:04:47,245
如果开火 可能会激活该装置
If you fire, it could activate the device.

39
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:51,124
放松你的手 丹尼尔
Loosen your grip, Daniel.

40
00:04:52,125 --> 00:04:54,294
用力挤压即可激活 请放松握力
If you squeeze, it activates. Soften your grip.

41
00:04:55,628 --> 00:04:57,505
放下它 你不会用它
Put it down. You don't know how to use it.

42
00:04:57,672 --> 00:04:59,799
-我知道你是怎么用的 -它差点要了我的命
-I know how you used it. -And it almost killed me.

43
00:04:59,924 --> 00:05:03,261
现在 将设备放在地上
Now, place the device on the ground.

44
00:05:03,344 --> 00:05:05,388
我应该以牙还牙 就像你对他们做的那样
I should do to you what you did to them.

45
00:05:05,555 --> 00:05:07,390
塞雷娜 冷静下来
Stand down, Serena.

46
00:05:11,102 --> 00:05:14,230
请勿对其施加任何压力
Do not exert any pressure on it.

47
00:05:14,397 --> 00:05:16,774
放松你的手
Just loosen your grip.

48
00:05:16,899 --> 00:05:18,401
放松你的手 就这样
Loosen your grip. That's it.

49
00:05:18,526 --> 00:05:19,986
张开你的手
Just open your hand.

50
00:05:21,029 --> 00:05:22,155
就是这样
That's it.

51
00:05:22,238 --> 00:05:23,990
好的 好的
Okay. Okay.

52
00:05:25,742 --> 00:05:27,994
把所有东西都塞进背包 然后上车
Sweep everything into the backpack and get in the car.

53
00:05:28,077 --> 00:05:29,620
拜托 简
Please, Jane.

54
00:05:32,123 --> 00:05:33,666
出去
Get out.

55
00:05:39,339 --> 00:05:41,174
你没有运行任何恶意软件操作
You're not running some malware op.

56
00:05:41,341 --> 00:05:43,926
在你的保密信息设施中 你不能躲在屏幕后面
You can't hide behind a screen in your SCIF.

57
00:05:44,052 --> 00:05:45,470
世界正处于崩溃的边缘
The world is on the brink.

58
00:05:45,553 --> 00:05:47,722
你真的认为倾销库存
Do you actually believe that dumping inventory

59
00:05:47,764 --> 00:05:50,433
除了造成危险的干扰之外 不会有其他好处吗？
will be anything more than a dangerous distraction?

60
00:05:51,642 --> 00:05:53,353
我旁听了审讯
I watched the interrogations.

61
00:05:54,395 --> 00:05:55,813
历史记录没有重置键
History doesn't have a reset key.

62
00:05:55,897 --> 00:05:57,690
如果你这样做 就无法挽回了
If you do this, there's no undoing it.

63
00:05:59,776 --> 00:06:01,694
这就是计划
That's the plan.

64
00:06:15,249 --> 00:06:17,043
博伊德
Boyd.

65
00:06:21,089 --> 00:06:23,049
他坐在桌子旁
He sits at a desk.

66
00:06:24,258 --> 00:06:26,177
他是怎么打败你的？
How did he beat you?

67
00:06:34,977 --> 00:06:36,604
他们说你犯了叛国罪？
They said you committed treason?

68
00:06:36,729 --> 00:06:38,147
这不是叛国罪 他们不是政府
It's not treason. They're not the government,

69
00:06:38,272 --> 00:06:39,649
而且他们靠撒谎为生
and they lie for a living.

70
00:06:39,857 --> 00:06:41,484
丹尼尔 到底发生了什么事？
What is going on, Daniel?

71
00:06:41,692 --> 00:06:42,985
他们的车装有追踪器
Their cars have trackers.

72
00:06:43,027 --> 00:06:44,320
我们必须摆脱它
We got to get rid of this.

73
00:06:44,529 --> 00:06:45,696
请带我回家吧
Please just take me home.

74
00:06:45,863 --> 00:06:47,907
他们会在你的公寓等你
They'd be waiting at your apartment.

75
00:06:48,032 --> 00:06:50,201
嘿 把透明塑料袋递给我
Hey, hand me the clear plastic bag.

76
00:06:53,538 --> 00:06:55,665
好的 稍微控制一下方向盘
Okay. Steer for a second.

77
00:06:57,166 --> 00:06:59,585
好的 好的
Okay. Okay.

78
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,925
好的 好的
Okay, okay.

79
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:07,468
Hugo 我明白了
Hugo, I'm clear.

80
00:07:07,635 --> 00:07:10,138
丹尼尔 我为你感到骄傲
Daniel, I'm so proud of you.

81
00:07:10,221 --> 00:07:12,390
他们绑架了简 目的是为了找到我
They kidnapped Jane to get to me.

82
00:07:12,473 --> 00:07:14,142
她现在和我在一起
She's with me now.

83
00:07:14,225 --> 00:07:15,810
她没事吧？
Is she all right?

84
00:07:15,935 --> 00:07:17,520
不完全是 雨果
Not really, Hugo.

85
00:07:17,562 --> 00:07:18,855
我应该在哪里做drop？
Where do I do the drop?

86
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:20,565
尚未发布
No drop yet.

87
00:07:20,648 --> 00:07:22,567
-确保安全 然后... -不 不 不
-Get secure, and then... -No, no, no.

88
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:24,444
现在就派人去把包拿过来
Send the guy for the bag now.

89
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,320
需要有人来负责这件事
Somebody needs to run with this thing.

90
00:07:26,529 --> 00:07:27,780
那就是你
That's you.

91
00:07:27,864 --> 00:07:29,365
你拿到球了
You've got the ball.

92
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:32,160
我不要球
I don't want the ball.

93
00:07:32,285 --> 00:07:34,912
不 计划是我把它弄出设施 而且我做到了
No, the plan was I get it out of the facility, and I-I did.

94
00:07:34,996 --> 00:07:36,539
我认为你是最有资格
I decided you were best qualified

95
00:07:36,664 --> 00:07:37,999
保管这些材料的人
to keep the material safe.

96
00:07:38,082 --> 00:07:40,084
你疯了吗？
Are you out of your mind?

97
00:07:40,209 --> 00:07:42,628
不 我不是外勤人员 雨果
No, I'm not a field guy, Hugo.

98
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:44,881
技术工作是我做的 我只能做到这些
I-I did the tech work. That's all I can do.

99
00:07:45,047 --> 00:07:46,007
你就待在我身边
You just stay with me.

100
00:07:46,215 --> 00:07:47,467
我们按计划进行
We're on plan.

101
00:07:47,675 --> 00:07:50,136
正在等待其他人被激活
Waiting now for someone else to be activated.

102
00:07:50,178 --> 00:07:52,472
当他们出现时 我们就会知道接下来会发生什么
When they are, we'll know what comes next.

103
00:07:52,513 --> 00:07:55,141
把简安置在安全的地方 然后安心过夜
Leave Jane somewhere safe and get secure for the night.

104
00:07:55,308 --> 00:07:57,894
哦 不 我不会让她一个人待着的
Oh, no. I-I'm not leaving her alone.

105
00:07:57,977 --> 00:08:00,563
-没有你 她会更安全 -但她并非如此
-She'll be safer without you. -But she wasn't.

106
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:03,524
安全的时候 你需要留下一个标记
I'm gonna need you to drop a marker when you get secure.

107
00:08:03,691 --> 00:08:05,860
我们的朋友圣地亚哥明天早上会找到你
Our friend Santiago will find you in the morning.

108
00:08:06,027 --> 00:08:09,322
我现在应该把所有东西都上传到网上
I should just dump everything online right now.

109
00:08:11,032 --> 00:08:14,285
无论在任何情况下 你都不能这样做
You cannot, under any circumstances, do that.

110
00:08:15,828 --> 00:08:17,079
现在 我们只能等待
For now, we wait.

111
00:08:17,288 --> 00:08:19,081
保持警惕 寻找掩体
Stay alert. Find shelter.

112
00:08:19,207 --> 00:08:21,334
圣地亚哥早上会把我们聚在一起
Santiago will put us together in the morning.

113
00:08:22,251 --> 00:08:23,544
销毁你的手机
Destroy your phone.

114
00:08:26,631 --> 00:08:27,924
丹尼
Danny.

115
00:08:28,132 --> 00:08:30,343
卫星一次性手机
Satellite burner phones.

116
00:08:30,468 --> 00:08:31,928
他们有自己的加密网络
They got their own encrypted network.

117
00:08:32,053 --> 00:08:33,846
我们只使用一次
We only use them once.

118
00:08:36,349 --> 00:08:38,601
你的职业具体是做什么的？
What exactly do you do for a living?

119
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:41,395
我们今晚得确保安全
We got to get secure for the night.

120
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:43,314
没有公寓 没有汽车旅馆
No apartments, no motels.

121
00:08:43,397 --> 00:08:46,317
必须是我这辈子从未去过的地方
Has to be somewhere I've never been before in my life.

122
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:49,987
我知道附近有个地方
I know a place close to here.

123
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:05,878
国防部的马斯格雷夫想要听取简报
Musgrave at DoD wants a briefing.

124
00:09:06,003 --> 00:09:08,047
立即把韦克菲尔德弄到这里来
Get Wakefield down here now.

125
00:09:08,214 --> 00:09:09,924
告诉穆斯格雷夫 这只是一次轻微的违规行为
Tell Musgrave it was a minor breach.

126
00:09:10,007 --> 00:09:11,384
恢复正在进行中
Recovery is in process.

127
00:09:11,509 --> 00:09:13,344
先生 他不会想从我这里听到这些
Sir, he will not want to hear it from me.

128
00:09:13,469 --> 00:09:15,429
如果我接电话 就表示我很担心
If I pick up the phone, it means I'm concerned.

129
00:09:15,555 --> 00:09:17,390
如果他们哪怕闻到一丝风声 我们一个小时内就会把整个
If they even get a whiff of that, we'll have the entire

130
00:09:17,431 --> 00:09:19,767
军事和情报机构都调到这里来
military and intelligence apparatus up here in an hour.

131
00:09:19,976 --> 00:09:21,227
处理他
Handle him.

132
00:09:21,352 --> 00:09:22,895
新闻推送里有相关的内容吗？
Anything relevant to this on news feeds?

133
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:24,272
尚未
Not yet.

134
00:09:24,355 --> 00:09:25,940
社交账号还是安全私密账号？
Socials or secure private?

135
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:27,733
一片寂静
All quiet.

136
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:32,989
今天有12人未到场
12 no-shows here today.

137
00:09:36,450 --> 00:09:38,327
所有办公桌都是空的
All with empty desks.

138
00:09:38,369 --> 00:09:40,621
所有高于 G5 的间隙
All clearance above G5.

139
00:09:49,255 --> 00:09:51,924
好的 所以我们正在处理一项
All right, so we're dealing with an operation

140
00:09:52,091 --> 00:09:55,344
精心协调和执行的行动
carefully coordinated and executed.

141
00:09:56,637 --> 00:09:59,223
为什么？目的是什么？
Why? With what goal?

142
00:09:59,432 --> 00:10:00,891
如果他们想公开档案
If they wanted the archive out,

143
00:10:00,975 --> 00:10:02,351
凯尔纳早就公开了
Kellner would have already released it,

144
00:10:02,476 --> 00:10:03,853
但他没有公开 这意味着
but he hasn't, which means

145
00:10:03,978 --> 00:10:05,688
有人在保留决策空间
somebody's maintaining decision space.

146
00:10:05,813 --> 00:10:09,483
但是能持续多久 我们不知道 所以要尽快想办法
But for how long, we don't know, so think quickly.

147
00:10:09,567 --> 00:10:11,110
Daniel Kellner 拥有
Daniel Kellner has a doctorate

148
00:10:11,193 --> 00:10:12,862
理论和应用网络安全博士学位
in theoretical and applied cybersecurity,

149
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:14,739
并且他花了近八年时间
and he's spent the better part of eight years

150
00:10:14,864 --> 00:10:16,365
保护高端数据
safeguarding high-side data,

151
00:10:16,407 --> 00:10:18,284
这告诉我们关于他什么呢？
so what does that tell us about him?

152
00:10:18,492 --> 00:10:19,535
想法
Ideas.

153
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:20,661
-来吧 -他建造了防火墙
-Come on. -He built the firewalls.

154
00:10:20,703 --> 00:10:22,163
他知道如何突破它们
He knows how to breach them.

155
00:10:22,371 --> 00:10:23,748
他们已经被攻破了 我们得克服这个难关
They're already breached. We got to play past that.

156
00:10:23,831 --> 00:10:25,207
我们必须维持标准的跳跃追踪
We got to maintain standard skip tracing.

157
00:10:25,249 --> 00:10:26,626
嗯 我可以访问 SYNTRAK
Well, I can access SYNTRAK.

158
00:10:26,751 --> 00:10:28,336
他接下来会做什么？
What's the next thing he does?

159
00:10:28,502 --> 00:10:30,671
先生
Sir.

160
00:10:30,796 --> 00:10:33,758
Hugo Wakefield今天早上没来上班
Hugo Wakefield didn't show up for work this morning.

161
00:10:35,468 --> 00:10:38,262
他的桌子被清空了
His desk was cleaned out.

162
00:10:38,346 --> 00:10:40,056
雨果？
Hugo?

163
00:10:43,017 --> 00:10:46,228
第二个设备在深度存储中缺失
Second device is missing from deep storage.

164
00:10:46,354 --> 00:10:48,105
第三个在哪里？
Where's the third?

165
00:10:48,230 --> 00:10:50,066
被锁在冷藏室里
Locked down in the cold room.

166
00:11:30,648 --> 00:11:33,442
你怎么知道他们会回答？
How do you know they'll answer it?

167
00:11:33,651 --> 00:11:35,444
因为这就是我们所做的
'Cause that's what we do.

168
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,155
你是怎么知道这个地方的？
How do you know this place?

169
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,203
简
Jane.

170
00:11:45,371 --> 00:11:48,290
哦...哦 亲爱的
Oh... oh, my dear.

171
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:54,797
主教大人终于交出了他的运动鞋
The monsignor has finally surrendered his sneakers.

172
00:11:54,964 --> 00:11:56,298
哦
Oh.

173
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:57,883
哦 我受不了他的其他鞋子
Oh, I couldn't bear his other shoes.

174
00:11:58,008 --> 00:12:00,261
我知道 它们总是发出很刺耳的吱吱声
I know. They always squeaked so horribly.

175
00:12:04,181 --> 00:12:07,601
哦 亲爱的 我们非常想念你
Oh, we have missed you very much, my dear.

176
00:12:07,810 --> 00:12:09,478
哦 拜托
Oh, come on.

177
00:12:09,603 --> 00:12:11,397
我所做的只是让你和其他姐妹们抓狂
All I ever did was drive you and the other sisters crazy.

178
00:12:11,439 --> 00:12:15,109
嗯 你问的问题真多
Mm, well, you do ask a lot of questions.

179
00:12:15,234 --> 00:12:17,153
特蕾莎最终完成她的见习期了吗？
Did Teresa ever get through her postulancy?

180
00:12:17,278 --> 00:12:18,571
她顺利通过
She sailed through.

181
00:12:18,696 --> 00:12:20,740
自从她不再晚上偷偷溜出去之后
Once she stopped sneaking out at night.

182
00:12:20,823 --> 00:12:22,283
编号
No.

183
00:12:22,408 --> 00:12:23,367
这位蒙席正在圣安东尼
The monsignor has her teaching

184
00:12:23,534 --> 00:12:25,369
学校教三年级
