00:35:35,591 --> 00:35:37,301
-这里 -谢谢
-Here. -Thank you.

695
00:35:39,387 --> 00:35:41,472
你好吗？
How's it going?

696
00:35:59,490 --> 00:36:01,159
WARDEX？
WARDEX?

697
00:36:01,242 --> 00:36:04,829
代表豁免报告开发和提取
Stands for Waived Reporting Development and Extraction.

698
00:36:06,038 --> 00:36:07,665
什么？
Of what?

699
00:36:24,807 --> 00:36:28,769
佛罗里达州霍姆斯特德空军基地 1973 年
Homestead Air Force Base in Florida, 1973.

700
00:36:29,812 --> 00:36:31,439
和尼克松在一起的那个人是谁？
Who's the guy with Nixon?

701
00:36:31,564 --> 00:36:33,191
50年代的大电视明星
Big TV star in the '50s.

702
00:36:33,274 --> 00:36:35,276
尼克松想给他留下深刻印象
Nixon wanted to impress him.

703
00:37:22,949 --> 00:37:24,742
他们是孩子吗？
Are they children?

704
00:37:24,909 --> 00:37:26,410
编号
No.

705
00:37:29,497 --> 00:37:32,416
他们是...人吗？
Are they... people?

706
00:37:32,583 --> 00:37:34,418
编号
No.

707
00:37:37,922 --> 00:37:39,674
他们是人类吗？
Are they human?

708
00:37:52,728 --> 00:37:54,897
接下来的部分令人难以观看
This next part's hard to watch.

709
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:59,277
是雨果向我展示的东西让我入了坑
It's what Hugo showed me that got me into this.

710
00:38:00,820 --> 00:38:02,071
好的？
Okay?

711
00:38:07,827 --> 00:38:09,412
好的
Okay.

712
00:38:12,290 --> 00:38:13,958
我们需要生命体征
We're gonna need vitals.

713
00:38:14,041 --> 00:38:15,584
我们没有基线
We've got no baseline.

714
00:38:15,626 --> 00:38:17,003
脉搏血氧仪无法读取
Pulse ox can't read.

715
00:38:17,169 --> 00:38:18,671
-没有标准地标... -氯胺酮？
-No standard landmarks... -Ketamine?

716
00:38:18,879 --> 00:38:20,089
-四到六毫克？ -不再使用镇静剂
-Four to six milligrams? -No more sedatives.

717
00:38:20,256 --> 00:38:21,841
我首先需要基线压力数据
I want baseline stress data first.

718
00:38:22,008 --> 00:38:23,884
调整握法 固定脚踝
Shift your grip. Secure the ankles.

719
00:38:24,010 --> 00:38:26,429
稳定头部和右臂
Stabilize head and right arm.

720
00:38:30,808 --> 00:38:32,226
头部晃动幅度过大
Head's moving too much.

721
00:38:32,268 --> 00:38:33,811
我需要一个带衬垫的约束带
I need a padded restraint.

722
00:38:33,894 --> 00:38:35,938
我有了 我需要脑脊液
I have it. I need cerebrospinal fluid.

723
00:38:36,105 --> 00:38:38,441
将针推进18厘米
Advance the needle 18 centimeters,

724
00:38:38,482 --> 00:38:40,234
延髓腹侧
ventral to the medulla.

725
00:38:40,359 --> 00:38:42,445
它情况危急 正在注射丙泊酚
It's in distress. Administering propofol.

726
00:38:42,611 --> 00:38:44,530
阴性 未麻醉
Negative. No anesthesia.

727
00:38:44,613 --> 00:38:46,657
我们那样丢了一个 现在就做
We lost one that way. Do it now.

728
00:38:46,741 --> 00:38:47,950
立即插入
Insert it now.

729
00:39:04,091 --> 00:39:05,509
还有更多
There's more.

730
00:39:05,634 --> 00:39:08,679
79 年
79 years more.

731
00:39:10,681 --> 00:39:12,391
我全都有
I have all of it.

732
00:39:34,789 --> 00:39:38,000
只有雨果与它有关系
Hugo is the only one who had a relationship with it,

733
00:39:38,042 --> 00:39:40,586
而且他知道自己在用那东西做什么
and he knew what he was doing with that thing.

734
00:39:40,669 --> 00:39:42,713
调出凯尔纳的数据
Pull up Kellner's data.

735
00:39:47,968 --> 00:39:49,303
把设备给我
Give me the device.

736
00:39:49,428 --> 00:39:50,888
如果收缩压低于90
If systolic goes below 90

737
00:39:51,055 --> 00:39:52,390
像上次那样 我就把你拉出来
like last time, I'm pulling you out.

738
00:39:52,515 --> 00:39:53,891
注意快速性心律失常
Watch for tachyarrhythmia,

739
00:39:53,933 --> 00:39:55,601
-硬膜下出血 -复制
-subdural hemorrhage. -Copy.

740
00:40:20,167 --> 00:40:22,294
我没事 我没事！
I'm fine. I'm fine!

741
00:40:22,336 --> 00:40:24,046
发生了什么事？
What happened?

742
00:40:26,215 --> 00:40:28,551
我全神贯注 全身心投入
I had focus, gave myself over,

743
00:40:28,634 --> 00:40:31,345
瞥见凯尔纳一瞬间 然后...
saw Kellner for a split second, then...

744
00:40:31,554 --> 00:40:33,013
大锤 一片空白
sledgehammer, whiteout.

745
00:40:33,097 --> 00:40:35,516
把我的肺里的空气都抽走了
Sucked all the air out of my lungs.

746
00:40:35,724 --> 00:40:37,643
他是体验者吗？
Is he an experiencer?

747
00:40:37,768 --> 00:40:39,437
你不能跳到它们上面
You can't dive on them.

748
00:40:41,730 --> 00:40:43,983
他不可能在那里 如果是的话 我肯定会知道
He can't have been. I'd have known.

749
00:40:44,191 --> 00:40:45,776
他是雨果的人
He's Hugo's guy.

750
00:40:45,901 --> 00:40:48,154
还有很多我们不知道的事情
There's gonna be a whole lot we don't know.

751
00:40:48,362 --> 00:40:51,031
也许吧 但我不会再进去一探究竟
Maybe, but I'm not going back in there to find out.

752
00:41:01,083 --> 00:41:03,294
获取女朋友的数据
Pull the data on the girlfriend.

753
00:41:04,670 --> 00:41:08,466
曾有过一些异域飞行器的回收计划
There have been retrieval programs of exotic craft.

754
00:41:09,467 --> 00:41:12,970
对非人类生物制品的审讯
Interrogation of nonhuman biologics.

755
00:41:13,053 --> 00:41:16,182
逆向工程和技术利用
Reverse engineering and technology exploitation.

756
00:41:16,348 --> 00:41:17,808
所有这一切...
All of it...

757
00:41:17,975 --> 00:41:20,728
由 WARDEX 国防部
run by WARDEX, the Department of Defense

758
00:41:20,936 --> 00:41:23,022
和国防工业运营
and the defense industry.

759
00:41:23,105 --> 00:41:25,608
它拥有美国历史上最高的军事
It has the highest level of military

760
00:41:25,649 --> 00:41:27,151
和私营部门分类
and private sector classification

761
00:41:27,234 --> 00:41:28,569
级别
in American history.

762
00:41:30,112 --> 00:41:31,447
他们从 70 年代初就开始运营它
They've run it since the early '70s

763
00:41:31,572 --> 00:41:32,823
没有政府资助
without government funding.

764
00:41:32,948 --> 00:41:34,867
太多的税款需要隐藏
Too many tax dollars to try and hide,

765
00:41:35,034 --> 00:41:37,369
而且外星文物利润太高
and-and off-world artifacts are too profitable

766
00:41:37,536 --> 00:41:39,121
不能交给指定的官员
to leave in the hands of appointed officials,

767
00:41:39,330 --> 00:41:42,041
尤其是在尼克松事件之后
especially after the Nixon thing.

768
00:41:42,166 --> 00:41:45,753
总统在八年后又变回了平民 所以...
Presidents are civilians again after eight years, so...

769
00:41:45,878 --> 00:41:49,173
所以没有理由再让他们了解这一切了
so there's no longer a reason to read them in on any of this.

770
00:41:51,175 --> 00:41:54,512
我曾经也是这一切的一部分 直到我看到了你刚才看到的东西
I was a part of all that until I saw what you just saw.

771
00:41:55,596 --> 00:41:59,058
这一切到此结束
This all stops now.

772
00:41:59,141 --> 00:42:00,726
你打算怎么办？
What are you gonna do?

773
00:42:01,769 --> 00:42:06,440
一次性向全世界完全公开
Full disclosure to the whole world all at once.

774
00:42:09,193 --> 00:42:12,154
你考虑过这会造成什么影响吗？
Have you considered what effect that'll have?

775
00:42:13,280 --> 00:42:15,032
所有东西？
On everything?

776
00:42:16,033 --> 00:42:17,368
什么...
What...

777
00:42:17,493 --> 00:42:19,203
这并非由我决定...
It's not up to me to decide if it's...

778
00:42:19,245 --> 00:42:22,081
这究竟是好是坏 还是应该让别人知道
if it's good or bad for people to know.

779
00:42:22,289 --> 00:42:25,000
那么 凭什么由你来决定知情权
Then how is it up to you to decide that the right to know

780
00:42:25,084 --> 00:42:27,378
是否大于知情的后果呢？
outweighs the consequences of knowing?

781
00:42:27,503 --> 00:42:29,255
你是说我们要把这件事交给WARDEX来处理吗？
Are you saying we leave this up to WARDEX?

782
00:42:29,338 --> 00:42:31,757
因为他们...他们已经决定这属于他们
'Cause they-they've already decided this belongs to them,

783
00:42:31,882 --> 00:42:34,510
关于宇宙的核心真理
this core truth about the universe.

784
00:42:34,635 --> 00:42:36,887
-这是错误的 -你不能这样做
-It's wrong. -You can't do that.

785
00:42:38,013 --> 00:42:39,723
想想...
Think about...

786
00:42:41,308 --> 00:42:42,685
人们会将他们视为神明
People will see them as deities.

787
00:42:42,768 --> 00:42:44,812
他们将不再信仰上帝
They'll stop believing in God.

788
00:42:44,853 --> 00:42:46,689
好吧 你离开了教会
Well, you left the church.

789
00:42:46,814 --> 00:42:48,148
不是因为我不再相信
Not because I stopped believing,

790
00:42:48,232 --> 00:42:49,817
因为我不能再肯定地说
because I could no longer say with certainty

791
00:42:49,984 --> 00:42:51,235
上帝是神圣的
that God is divine,

792
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:54,572
但我深信他是必不可少的
but I believe profoundly that he's essential.

793
00:42:56,323 --> 00:42:57,783
他就是我们对自己的定义
He's how we define ourselves.

794
00:42:57,950 --> 00:43:00,911
他是维系整个文明的关键
He's what keeps whole civilizations together.

795
00:43:02,288 --> 00:43:05,082
我们从小就被灌输信仰至高无上的神灵
We've been raised to believe in a supreme being,

796
00:43:05,207 --> 00:43:08,961
