and now you want to show us actual supreme beings?

797
00:43:09,044 --> 00:43:10,879
人们无法同时兼顾两者
People can't handle both.

798
00:43:13,340 --> 00:43:14,967
当然可以
Of course they can.

799
00:43:15,175 --> 00:43:16,594
不 他们不能
No, they can't.

800
00:43:17,595 --> 00:43:19,680
回顾我们历史上的任何突发变化
Look at our history with any sudden change.

801
00:43:20,681 --> 00:43:25,019
现在 世界即将在我们所有人面前爆炸？
And now, with the world about to blow up in all our faces?

802
00:43:26,478 --> 00:43:31,066
你会陷入恐慌和混乱 上帝保佑我们
You'll get panic and-and chaos, and God help us.

803
00:43:35,237 --> 00:43:37,448
Hugo 等着我报到
Hugo's expecting me to check in.

804
00:43:49,168 --> 00:43:50,919
无信号
No signal.

805
00:43:52,671 --> 00:43:54,298
无信号
No signal.

806
00:43:54,465 --> 00:43:56,717
我试试山坡的另一边
I'll try the other side of the hill.

807
00:44:26,622 --> 00:44:27,790
好的
Okay.

808
00:44:27,998 --> 00:44:29,249
打开门！
Unlock the door!

809
00:44:29,416 --> 00:44:30,626
-什么？ -杰克逊 加油！
-What? -Jackson, come on!

810
00:44:30,668 --> 00:44:32,461
哦 糟糕 对不起
Oh, shit. Sorry.

811
00:44:33,587 --> 00:44:35,255
哦 对不起 对不起
Oh, sorry, sorry.

812
00:44:35,422 --> 00:44:37,841
-好的 -我的天哪
-Okay. -Oh, my God.

813
00:44:43,681 --> 00:44:45,140
如果你用法语回答这个问题 我向上帝发誓
If you answer that in French, I swear to God

814
00:44:45,265 --> 00:44:46,517
我会把你押回里面
I'm marching you right back inside.

815
00:44:46,725 --> 00:44:48,227
你好？
Hello?

816
00:44:48,310 --> 00:44:50,187
我等了很久
I've been waiting a very long time

817
00:44:50,270 --> 00:44:52,481
才见到您 费尔柴尔德小姐
to meet you, Ms. Fairchild.

818
00:44:52,606 --> 00:44:54,024
这是谁？
Who is this?

819
00:44:54,191 --> 00:44:55,859
一位朋友
A friend.

820
00:44:56,985 --> 00:44:59,738
如果我对你的看法是对的 玛格丽特
And if I'm right about you, Margaret,

821
00:44:59,822 --> 00:45:01,323
如果我错了 你会知道的
you'd know if I wasn't.

822
00:45:01,448 --> 00:45:02,783
不 我不...我不了解你
No, I don't... I don't know you

823
00:45:02,866 --> 00:45:04,618
就像我不了解发生在我身上的事一样
any more than I know what's happening to me.

824
00:45:04,785 --> 00:45:06,912
很少有人能像你一样把这件事做得这么好
Very few people could manage this as well as you.

825
00:45:07,079 --> 00:45:08,831
-我管理不了 我真的管理不了 -那是谁？
-I'm not managing it. I'm not. -Who-who is that?

826
00:45:08,872 --> 00:45:11,291
我害怕极了 我吓得魂飞魄散
I am frightened. I'm frightened out of my wits.

827
00:45:11,417 --> 00:45:15,379
因为你只是旅途中的一个乘客
Because you're just a passenger on your way somewhere.

828
00:45:15,504 --> 00:45:17,256
-让我们助您达成目标 -请帮帮我？
-Let us help you get there. -Help me how?

829
