No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

1076
01:04:10,429 --> 01:04:11,806
不 不 不 不 不
No, no, no, no, no.

1077
01:04:11,889 --> 01:04:13,724
听着 简 不是你 不是你
Look, Jane, it wasn't you. It wasn't you.

1078
