是斯坎伦
It was Scanlon.

1079
01:04:15,268 --> 01:04:16,519
该设备 该设备
The device. The device.

1080
01:04:16,644 --> 01:04:19,021
掷骰子让他掷三 一 二 三 开始
Roll him on three. One, two, three, go.

1081
