-Anybody got eyes on anything? -They must have gone over.

1093
01:06:05,169 --> 01:06:06,671
请求水下搜索和打捞
Requesting underwater search and recovery

1094
01:06:06,879 --> 01:06:08,130
-现在就在现场 -他们倒下了 他们倒下了
-on site right now. -They're down. They're down.

1095
01:06:08,255 --> 01:06:09,882
他们倒下了 他们掉进水里了
They're down. They're in the water.

1096
01:06:10,049 --> 01:06:11,175
我们能派个小组下去看看能不能找到他们吗？
Can we get a team down there and see if we can find them?

1097
01:06:11,258 --> 01:06:12,760
-我们需要一些潜水员 -就在那里
-We need some divers. -Down there.

1098
01:06:36,033 --> 01:06:37,660
他们都认为世界正在走向毁灭
They all think the world's going to hell.

1099
