Uh, uh, yes, yes. Thank you, thank you for taking the call.

1143
01:08:56,674 --> 01:08:58,384
呃 我不知道
Uh, I-I don't know.

1144
01:08:58,551 --> 01:09:02,346
她刚刚离开 是的 情况越来越糟 糟得多
She just took off, and y-y-yes, it's getting worse, much worse.

1145
01:09:02,429 --> 01:09:03,722
好的 谢谢
Yes, please. Thank you.

1146
01:09:03,889 --> 01:09:05,015
