Danny, I'm gonna ask you to do something.

1194
01:12:42,316 --> 01:12:44,193
我希望你先看一下这个
I want you first to look at this.

1195
01:12:48,781 --> 01:12:50,532
你听懂她说什么了吗？
Do you understand what she's saying?

1196
01:12:51,658 --> 01:12:53,452
我听到她说话了 这...这都是胡言乱语
I hear her. It-it's gibberish.

1197
01:12:53,619 --> 01:12:55,037
我看不懂
I can't understand it.

1198
01:12:55,204 --> 01:12:58,916
好吧 我刚听到这个
Okay, I-I just heard this for the first time,

1199
01:12:59,083 --> 01:13:00,417
我可以
and I can.

1200
01:13:00,501 --> 01:13:02,002
-这是英语 -英语？
-It's English. -English?

1201
01:13:02,127 --> 01:13:04,254
我的意思是 它是...它是我脑海中数学转换成的英语
I mean, it's-it's math turned English in my head,

1202
01:13:04,338 --> 01:13:06,006
翻译成文字
translated into words.

1203
01:13:06,882 --> 01:13:10,302
当我看到这个时 我听到这个
When I look at this, I hear this.

1204
01:13:14,848 --> 01:13:17,226
丹尼 我要请你做件事
Danny, I'm gonna ask you to do something.

1205
01:13:26,151 --> 01:13:27,903
你不能再信任我了
You can't trust me anymore.

1206
01:14:42,269 --> 01:14:44,062
抓到他了
Got him.

1207
01:15:35,697 --> 01:15:37,115
他们来了
They're here.

1208
01:15:37,157 --> 01:15:38,492
-他们来了 -什么？
-They're here. -What?

1209
01:15:38,617 --> 01:15:40,786
-走那一端 -加油 加油 加油
-Take that end. -Go, go, go.

1210
01:15:44,248 --> 01:15:47,042
-背包 背包！ -你先来
-The backpack. The backpack! -You first.

1211
01:15:59,513 --> 01:16:00,639
来吧
Come on.

1212
01:16:00,764 --> 01:16:02,975
这就是我全部的家当了
This is all I've got.

1213
01:16:03,141 --> 01:16:04,518
你会来 对吧？
You're coming, right?

1214
01:16:04,643 --> 01:16:05,936
糟糕
Shit.

1215
01:16:05,978 --> 01:16:07,229
突破！就在这里！
Breach! Here!

1216
01:16:09,940 --> 01:16:10,983
-不 拜托 拜托 拜托 -你必须接受这个
-No, come on, come on, come on. -You got to take this.

1217
01:16:12,985 --> 01:16:15,988
看在上帝的份上 简 别碰里面的东西
And for God's sake, Jane, don't touch what's inside.

1218
01:16:16,071 --> 01:16:17,114
走 走
Go. Go.

1219
01:16:23,078 --> 01:16:25,581
快离开那里！
Get out of there!

1220
01:16:31,962 --> 01:16:33,755
趴下！
Get on the ground!

1221
01:16:36,508 --> 01:16:38,218
它们被烧毁了
They're burned.

1222
01:16:54,359 --> 01:16:56,111
它不在这里
It's not here.

1223
01:17:00,866 --> 01:17:02,451
设备在哪里？
Where's the device?

1224
01:17:43,617 --> 01:17:44,993
丹尼尔 你被误导了
You've been misled, Daniel.

1225
01:17:45,160 --> 01:17:47,746
我们可以以后再谈谈这一切对我造成
We can talk another time about how hurtful

1226
01:17:47,913 --> 01:17:49,331
的伤害 但我们现在
all this has been to me,

1227
01:17:49,414 --> 01:17:51,917
就在这里
but here we are.

1228
01:17:52,084 --> 01:17:53,669
档案安全无虞
The archive's safe.

1229
01:17:53,877 --> 01:17:56,171
现在你要告诉我 WARDEX
